list.synopsis:
(Gender transformation (yuri) + multiple female leads + transmigration + campus + daily life + close affection)

Xia Er, a pure and innocent high school boy, crossdresses for the first time—cosplaying the character he personally raised in a game: “Er’er,” an irresistibly cute white-haired, twin-tailed magical girl.

Then, in that very form, he suddenly transmigrates into the game world.

Despite having a max-level account, he misses the placement test and gets thrown into the school’s notoriously worst class.

From then on, Xia Er’s daily life becomes:

Being constantly fed by an adorable and clingy deskmate;
Being treated like a personal pet and trained daily by a battle-crazed red-haired top student;
Being held and comforted in the arms of a gentle, moonlight-like senior;
Being kept close under the pretense of “investigation” by a cold, genius student council president;
And even the mysterious Chief High Priest seems to be looking at him in an increasingly strange way…?

Xia Er: Wait… hold on… something about this feels very wrong?!
